# **THE ROSTER IMPLIES MORE THAN ONE, so a bare `.venv` is not enough.** No single
# `transformers` satisfies every checkpoint -- 13 nodes cannot run 5.x and 3
# cannot run 4.57 -- so `scripts/venvs.py` derives one venv per exact pin and
# names them `.venv-tf457` and so on. The template's single line would have
# tracked every one of them.
.venv-*/
env/
venv/
